<title>TURKEY: Turkish trader importing 25,000 T Argentine wheat.</title>
<headline>Turkish trader importing 25,000 T Argentine wheat.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Turkish trade company has agreed to import 25,000 tonnes of Argentine milling wheat with loading in December, a company official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have agreed to buy Argentine wheat. The loading will be in December,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
</text>
